  <div class="wrap thanks">
    <h1>You're on the calendar.</h1>
    <p class="lede">You'll get a confirmation email from Google with the time and a link for the call. If something comes up, use the link in that email to change it.</p>
    <p>To make the most of 30 minutes, it helps to have handy:</p>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li>Your website or store link, if you have one</li>
      <li>What you sell and how people buy from you now</li>
      <li>The one thing you'd most like fixed</li>
      <li>A rough idea of timing and budget, even if it's a guess</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Talk soon,<br>Craig</p>
  </div>
</section>
